# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# JobAI Frontend — Mode 1: TOGETHER (local dev, default)
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#
# Vite proxies /api → http://localhost:5000 automatically.
# No CORS issues. No absolute URLs. Just leave this file as-is.
#
# Copy to .env:  cp frontend/.env.mode1 frontend/.env
# (Or just delete frontend/.env entirely — same effect)
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# Leave empty — Vite proxy handles routing to localhost:5000
VITE_API_URL=
